  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-54b846ab-7fff-8ede-97db-f333004162ce&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.2;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;The proposed change of use from Class C3(a) to Class C3(b) would remain within the same use class as defined by the Use Classes Order. As such, it would not constitute development under Section 55 of the 1990 Act and does not require planning permission.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
